{"id":"1fc4c0c7a21cd8c1","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-directed.md","title":"Directed","display":"df-directed — Directed","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-directed","aliases":["58-df-directed"],"display":"df-directed — Directed","depends_on":["[[../batch12/58-df-set.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-relation.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-directed"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-directed</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-directed — Directed"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7ccfc8c88f29968a\" href=\"?note=7ccfc8c88f29968a\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-relation.md\">../batch18/58-df-relation.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\in V\">\\(I\\in V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-set.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_I\\subseteq I\\times I\">\\(\\leq_I\\subseteq I\\times I\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7ccfc8c88f29968a\" href=\"?note=7ccfc8c88f29968a\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-relation.md\">../batch18/58-df-relation.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Directed}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Directed}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}directed} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Directed}_S(I,\\leq_I)\\leftrightarrow\nI\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\leq_I\\subseteq I\\times I\\land\n\\forall i\\in I\\;(\\langle i,i\\rangle\\in\\leq_I)\\land\n\\forall i,j,k\\in I\\;\\bigl((\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in\\leq_I\\land\n\\langle j,k\\rangle\\in\\leq_I)\\to\\langle i,k\\rangle\\in\\leq_I\\bigr)\\land\n\\forall i,j\\in I\\;\\exists k\\in I\\;(\\langle i,k\\rangle\\in\\leq_I\\land\n\\langle j,k\\rangle\\in\\leq_I)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}directed} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Directed}_S(I,\\leq_I)\\leftrightarrow\nI\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\leq_I\\subseteq I\\times I\\land\n\\forall i\\in I\\;(\\langle i,i\\rangle\\in\\leq_I)\\land\n\\forall i,j,k\\in I\\;\\bigl((\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in\\leq_I\\land\n\\langle j,k\\rangle\\in\\leq_I)\\to\\langle i,k\\rangle\\in\\leq_I\\bigr)\\land\n\\forall i,j\\in I\\;\\exists k\\in I\\;(\\langle i,k\\rangle\\in\\leq_I\\land\n\\langle j,k\\rangle\\in\\leq_I)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Directed preorders index nets and directed systems; reflexivity, transitivity, and upper bounds are stated through the declared relation set.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch12/58-df-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"7ccfc8c88f29968a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-relation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$I\\in V$ (see [[../batch12/58-df-set.md]]).","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"7ccfc8c88f29968a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\leq_I\\subseteq I\\times I$ (see [[../batch18/58-df-relation.md]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"I\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_I\\subseteq I\\times I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Directed}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}directed} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Directed}_S(I,\\leq_I)\\leftrightarrow\nI\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\leq_I\\subseteq I\\times I\\land\n\\forall i\\in I\\;(\\langle i,i\\rangle\\in\\leq_I)\\land\n\\forall i,j,k\\in I\\;\\bigl((\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in\\leq_I\\land\n\\langle j,k\\rangle\\in\\leq_I)\\to\\langle i,k\\rangle\\in\\leq_I\\bigr)\\land\n\\forall i,j\\in I\\;\\exists k\\in I\\;(\\langle i,k\\rangle\\in\\leq_I\\land\n\\langle j,k\\rangle\\in\\leq_I)","display":true}],"bytes":1020,"backlinks":[{"id":"df8e5b5b4dea8723","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Directed}_S$ (directed-set predicate, see [[../batch14/58-df-directed.md]])"},{"id":"c0f65843385cfcf5","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Directed}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (see [[./58-df-directed.md]])."},{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-110","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-directed]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-436","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-directed.md|58-df-directed]]（batch14）"}],"outgoing":["65d9a1e690c32aad","7ccfc8c88f29968a"]}